//- THE QUESTION (2:50, 3:10). The title asks it, the room learns the answer, the spine gets said out loud.
section

  section.statement(data-timing="40")
    h2 Can AI pass your accessibility audit?
    aside.notes
      ul
        li ⏱ 2:50
        li The title, as a real question.

  section.statement(data-timing="40")
    h2 Yes.
    h2.fragment Also no.
    aside.notes
      ul
        li Teach the room: when I ask, you answer "Yes. Also no."
        li Run it once for practice.

  section.statement.is-shout(data-timing="60")
    h2 A machine can prove a fail. It can never prove a pass.
    aside.notes
      ul
        li The spine. Everything else hangs off this.

  section.statement(data-timing="50")
    h2 95.9% of home pages fail.
    p.aside (WebAIM Million, 2026)
    aside.notes
      ul
        li Stakes. Vilnius: the EAA has applied since June 2025. London: the Equality Act.
